{
  "mn128:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 128 ",
  "mn128:0.2": "Upakkilesasutta ",
  "mn128:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn128:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosambiyaṁ viharati ghositārāme. ",
  "mn128:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena kosambiyaṁ bhikkhū bhaṇḍanajātā kalahajātā vivādāpannā aññamaññaṁ mukhasattīhi vitudantā viharanti. ",
  "mn128:3.1": "Atha kho aññataro bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhāsi. Ekamantaṁ ṭhito kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn128:3.2": "“idha, bhante, kosambiyaṁ bhikkhū bhaṇḍanajātā kalahajātā vivādāpannā aññamaññaṁ mukhasattīhi vitudantā viharanti. ",
  "mn128:3.3": "Sādhu, bhante, bhagavā yena te bhikkhū tenupasaṅkamatu anukampaṁ upādāyā”ti. ",
  "mn128:3.4": "Adhivāsesi bhagavā tuṇhībhāvena. ",
  "mn128:4.1": "Atha kho bhagavā yena te bhikkhū tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā te bhikkhū etadavoca: ",
  "mn128:4.2": "“alaṁ, bhikkhave, mā bhaṇḍanaṁ, mā kalahaṁ, mā viggahaṁ, mā vivādan”ti. ",
  "mn128:4.3": "Evaṁ vutte, aññataro bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn128:4.4": "“āgametu, bhante. ",
  "mn128:4.5": "Bhagavā dhammassāmī; ",
  "mn128:4.6": "appossukko, bhante, bhagavā diṭṭhadhammasukhavihāraṁ anuyutto viharatu; ",
  "mn128:4.7": "mayametena bhaṇḍanena kalahena viggahena vivādena paññāyissāmā”ti. ",
  "mn128:4.8": "Dutiyampi kho bhagavā te bhikkhū etadavoca: